{"3617290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Runix: Pinball Roguelike", "steam_appid": 3617290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/0d3094c47046745c5dff4ae91fb3a30d.avif?t=1787833328\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras_big/0d3094c47046745c5dff4ae91fb3a30d.avif?t=1787833328 width=800 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your playstyle by combining different balls, stats, and magical artifacts. Battle powerful enemies with unique mechanics with your pinball magic balls. Complete missions to earn gold, grow stronger, and unlock new powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path to restore balance to the world and become the ultimate Pinball Wizard. You are the last mage of the ancient Pinball Order. The only one able to bring balance to this universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/d4faede4acee3b73104bb325ee652870.avif?t=1787833328\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras_big/d4faede4acee3b73104bb325ee652870.avif?t=1787833328 width=800 height=21 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/2ee14222a9581533347e08d71a0c964f.poster.avif?t=1787833328\" width=750 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/2ee14222a9581533347e08d71a0c964f.webm?t=1787833328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/2ee14222a9581533347e08d71a0c964f.mp4?t=1787833328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/22cc857fed2d521314538f0c9f07e7c4.avif?t=1787833328\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras_big/22cc857fed2d521314538f0c9f07e7c4.avif?t=1787833328 width=800 height=21 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be challenging bosses awaiting you at the end of each scenario. Those bosses have their specific techniques that you will need to overcome to complete your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/d4faede4acee3b73104bb325ee652870.avif?t=1787833328\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras_big/d4faede4acee3b73104bb325ee652870.avif?t=1787833328 width=800 height=21 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/c7ffd8333e66aa70eac16ef883f5793b.poster.avif?t=1787833328\" width=750 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/c7ffd8333e66aa70eac16ef883f5793b.webm?t=1787833328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/c7ffd8333e66aa70eac16ef883f5793b.mp4?t=1787833328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/22cc857fed2d521314538f0c9f07e7c4.avif?t=1787833328\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras_big/22cc857fed2d521314538f0c9f07e7c4.avif?t=1787833328 width=800 height=21 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the archer towers to kill the enemies with arrows that you will activate in different ways. Using them in combination with some balls and artifacts will create powerful combo shots that will obliterate your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/d4faede4acee3b73104bb325ee652870.avif?t=1787833328\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras_big/d4faede4acee3b73104bb325ee652870.avif?t=1787833328 width=800 height=21 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/0c8fc2ea5516b3d8cf6d843c7606c4f7.poster.avif?t=1787833328\" width=750 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/0c8fc2ea5516b3d8cf6d843c7606c4f7.webm?t=1787833328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/0c8fc2ea5516b3d8cf6d843c7606c4f7.mp4?t=1787833328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/22cc857fed2d521314538f0c9f07e7c4.avif?t=1787833328\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras_big/22cc857fed2d521314538f0c9f07e7c4.avif?t=1787833328 width=800 height=21 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will move the ball using the ultimate magic when you have enough mana. This will allow you to change the ball's course and move it to where you want it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/d4faede4acee3b73104bb325ee652870.avif?t=1787833328\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras_big/d4faede4acee3b73104bb325ee652870.avif?t=1787833328 width=800 height=21 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/7733b82efb37b24b616f281001d0e6fc.poster.avif?t=1787833328\" width=750 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/7733b82efb37b24b616f281001d0e6fc.webm?t=1787833328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/7733b82efb37b24b616f281001d0e6fc.mp4?t=1787833328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/22cc857fed2d521314538f0c9f07e7c4.avif?t=1787833328\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras_big/22cc857fed2d521314538f0c9f07e7c4.avif?t=1787833328 width=800 height=21 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a lot of features in this game. Among all the functionalities that this game has, we can highlight the following ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/62c9581cc3d40f4262e38a9af1072e4f.avif?t=1787833328\" width=800 height=195 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ Different balls with different effects for powerful combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Different scenarios (pinball tables) with completely different mechanics to explore and master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards to compete against your friends or the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ Artifacts that will change the way you play pinball and the interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic pinball with improved elements that will make the game more interesting and appealing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your powers with permanent upgrades that will allow you to be even more powerful</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability: This game will give you ascension levels that will allow you to replay the game and test your skills in the harder scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Infinity mode: After you defeat the final boss with your deck, test the limit of the deck, going as long as you can!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/34d8dea8ce0cb0a78d225261a78c43e9.avif?t=1787833328\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras_big/34d8dea8ce0cb0a78d225261a78c43e9.avif?t=1787833328 width=800 height=49 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/0d3094c47046745c5dff4ae91fb3a30d.avif?t=1787833328\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras_big/0d3094c47046745c5dff4ae91fb3a30d.avif?t=1787833328 width=800 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your playstyle by combining different balls, stats, and magical artifacts. Battle powerful enemies with unique mechanics with your pinball magic balls. Complete missions to earn gold, grow stronger, and unlock new powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path to restore balance to the world and become the ultimate Pinball Wizard. You are the last mage of the ancient Pinball Order. The only one able to bring balance to this universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/d4faede4acee3b73104bb325ee652870.avif?t=1787833328\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras_big/d4faede4acee3b73104bb325ee652870.avif?t=1787833328 width=800 height=21 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/2ee14222a9581533347e08d71a0c964f.poster.avif?t=1787833328\" width=750 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/2ee14222a9581533347e08d71a0c964f.webm?t=1787833328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/2ee14222a9581533347e08d71a0c964f.mp4?t=1787833328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/22cc857fed2d521314538f0c9f07e7c4.avif?t=1787833328\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras_big/22cc857fed2d521314538f0c9f07e7c4.avif?t=1787833328 width=800 height=21 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be challenging bosses awaiting you at the end of each scenario. Those bosses have their specific techniques that you will need to overcome to complete your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/d4faede4acee3b73104bb325ee652870.avif?t=1787833328\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras_big/d4faede4acee3b73104bb325ee652870.avif?t=1787833328 width=800 height=21 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/c7ffd8333e66aa70eac16ef883f5793b.poster.avif?t=1787833328\" width=750 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/c7ffd8333e66aa70eac16ef883f5793b.webm?t=1787833328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/c7ffd8333e66aa70eac16ef883f5793b.mp4?t=1787833328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras/22cc857fed2d521314538f0c9f07e7c4.avif?t=1787833328\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617290/extras_big/22cc857fed2d521314538f0c9f07e7c4.avif?t=1787833328 width=800 height=21 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the archer towers to kill the enemies with arrows that you will activate in different ways. Using them in combination with some balls and artifacts will create powerful combo shots that will obliterate your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-alig